*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*FileSystem: False
*PCFileName: "k206.ppd"
*Manufacturer: "KONICA MINOLTA"
*ModelName: "bizhub 206"
*Product: "(bizhub 206)"
*NickName: "KONICA MINOLTA bizhub 206 (A4 default, real media sizes)"
*ShortNickName: "bizhub 206"
*ColorDevice: False
*cupsVersion: 2.4
*cupsSNMPSupplies: False
*cupsLanguages: "en_US"
*cupsBackSide: Normal
*APSupplies: "http://127.0.0.1:8001/konica206/"
*cupsFilter2: "image/jpeg image/jpeg 0 -"
*cupsFilter2: "image/png image/png 0 -"
*cupsFilter2: "application/vnd.cups-pdf application/pdf 10 -"
*cupsFilter2: "image/urf image/urf 100 -"
*cupsUrfSupported: "V1.5,W8,PQ3-4-5,DM1,FN3,IS20-19,MT1,OB10,RS300-600"

*% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*% Page sizes are the ten real sizes the PAPPL application advertises
*% (iso_a3/a4/a5/a6, iso_b4/b5, na_letter/legal/executive/invoice) with the
*% hardware margins of the bizhub 206 (about 4.2 mm on every edge).
*% CUPS' auto-generated "everywhere" PPD appends ".Borderless" to every entry
*% because the application reports zero margins, which is wrong for this
*% device and confusing in print dialogs. This PPD uses the plain names.
*% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*OpenUI *PageSize: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*en_US.Translation PageSize/Media Size: ""
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A3: "<</PageSize[841.89 1190.55]>>setpagedevice"
*en_US.PageSize A3/A3 (297 x 420 mm): ""
*PageSize A4: "<</PageSize[595.28 841.89]>>setpagedevice"
*en_US.PageSize A4/A4 (210 x 297 mm): ""
*PageSize A5: "<</PageSize[419.53 595.28]>>setpagedevice"
*en_US.PageSize A5/A5 (148 x 210 mm): ""
*PageSize A6: "<</PageSize[297.64 419.53]>>setpagedevice"
*en_US.PageSize A6/A6 (105 x 148 mm): ""
*PageSize ISOB4: "<</PageSize[708.66 1000.63]>>setpagedevice"
*en_US.PageSize ISOB4/ISO B4 (250 x 353 mm): ""
*PageSize ISOB5: "<</PageSize[498.90 708.66]>>setpagedevice"
*en_US.PageSize ISOB5/ISO B5 (176 x 250 mm): ""
*PageSize Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*en_US.PageSize Letter/Letter (8.5 x 11 in): ""
*PageSize Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]>>setpagedevice"
*en_US.PageSize Legal/Legal (8.5 x 14 in): ""
*PageSize Executive: "<</PageSize[522 756]>>setpagedevice"
*en_US.PageSize Executive/Executive (7.25 x 10.5 in): ""
*PageSize Statement: "<</PageSize[396 612]>>setpagedevice"
*en_US.PageSize Statement/Statement (5.5 x 8.5 in): ""
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A3: "<</PageSize[841.89 1190.55]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A4: "<</PageSize[595.28 841.89]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A5: "<</PageSize[419.53 595.28]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A6: "<</PageSize[297.64 419.53]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion ISOB4: "<</PageSize[708.66 1000.63]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion ISOB5: "<</PageSize[498.90 708.66]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Executive: "<</PageSize[522 756]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Statement: "<</PageSize[396 612]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*ImageableArea A3: "12 12 829.89 1178.55"
*PaperDimension A3: "841.89 1190.55"
*ImageableArea A4: "12 12 583.28 829.89"
*PaperDimension A4: "595.28 841.89"
*ImageableArea A5: "12 12 407.53 583.28"
*PaperDimension A5: "419.53 595.28"
*ImageableArea A6: "12 12 285.64 407.53"
*PaperDimension A6: "297.64 419.53"
*ImageableArea ISOB4: "12 12 696.66 988.63"
*PaperDimension ISOB4: "708.66 1000.63"
*ImageableArea ISOB5: "12 12 486.90 696.66"
*PaperDimension ISOB5: "498.90 708.66"
*ImageableArea Letter: "12 12 600 780"
*PaperDimension Letter: "612 792"
*ImageableArea Legal: "12 12 600 996"
*PaperDimension Legal: "612 1008"
*ImageableArea Executive: "12 12 510 744"
*PaperDimension Executive: "522 756"
*ImageableArea Statement: "12 12 384 600"
*PaperDimension Statement: "396 612"

*OpenUI *InputSlot: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *InputSlot
*en_US.Translation InputSlot/Media Source: ""
*DefaultInputSlot: Auto
*InputSlot Tray1: "<</MediaPosition 20>>setpagedevice"
*en_US.InputSlot Tray1/Tray 1: ""
*InputSlot ByPassTray: "<</MediaPosition 19>>setpagedevice"
*en_US.InputSlot ByPassTray/By-pass Tray: ""
*InputSlot Auto: "<</MediaPosition 0>>setpagedevice"
*en_US.InputSlot Auto/Automatic: ""
*CloseUI: *InputSlot

*% The device supports long-edge and short-edge duplex. Simplex is the default.
*OpenUI *Duplex: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Duplex
*en_US.Translation Duplex/2-Sided Printing: ""
*DefaultDuplex: None
*Duplex None: "<</Duplex false>>setpagedevice"
*en_US.Duplex None/Off (1-Sided): ""
*Duplex DuplexNoTumble: "<</Duplex true/Tumble false>>setpagedevice"
*en_US.Duplex DuplexNoTumble/Long-Edge (Portrait): ""
*Duplex DuplexTumble: "<</Duplex true/Tumble true>>setpagedevice"
*en_US.Duplex DuplexTumble/Short-Edge (Landscape): ""
*CloseUI: *Duplex

*OpenUI *cupsPrintQuality: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *cupsPrintQuality
*en_US.Translation cupsPrintQuality/Print Quality: ""
*DefaultcupsPrintQuality: Normal
*cupsPrintQuality Draft: "<</HWResolution[300 150]>>setpagedevice"
*en_US.cupsPrintQuality Draft/Draft: ""
*cupsPrintQuality Normal: "<</HWResolution[300 300]>>setpagedevice"
*en_US.cupsPrintQuality Normal/Normal: ""
*cupsPrintQuality High: "<</HWResolution[600 600]>>setpagedevice"
*en_US.cupsPrintQuality High/High: ""
*CloseUI: *cupsPrintQuality

*OpenUI *ColorModel: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*en_US.Translation ColorModel/Color Mode: ""
*DefaultColorModel: Gray
*ColorModel Gray: "<</cupsColorSpace 18/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsCompression 0>>setpagedevice"
*en_US.ColorModel Gray/Grayscale: ""
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*OpenUI *OutputBin: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *OutputBin
*en_US.Translation OutputBin/Output Bin: ""
*DefaultOutputBin: FaceDown
*DefaultOutputOrder: Normal
*OutputBin FaceDown: ""
*en_US.OutputBin FaceDown/Face Down: ""
*PageStackOrder FaceDown: Normal
*CloseUI: *OutputBin

*cupsSingleFile: true
